-- Residual opening audit. Reviewed construction boundaries:
-- quotient-ideal descent and quotient ring operations; finite coefficient
-- lifting and dual evaluations; original ZMT s=1, surjection, positive
-- clearing powers, component selection, and refinement. Source/target
-- slopes and the scalar square have named comparison steps.
